,\"title\":{\"text\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang, as the conflict on Pandora escalates and a new moral focus emerges.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":197,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":8,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000560\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002207\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002294\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005786\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005787\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007837\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17711\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17712\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17713\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000042\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000349\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000696\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002427\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000010\",\"0000000011\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a4cb369f-77c4-4fe1-8f85-dd5e76b195dd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007533\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008563\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007638\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The SpongeBob Movie: Search for Squarepants\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"SpongeBob and his Bikini Bottom friends set sail in their biggest, all-new, can’t miss cinematic event ever…The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants. Desperate to be a big guy, SpongeBob sets out to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs by following The Flying Dutchman – a mysterious swashbuckling ghost pirate – on a seafaring comedy- adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the deep sea, where no Sponge has gone before.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"SpongeBob and his Bikini Bottom friends set sail in their biggest, all-new, can’t miss cinematic event ever…The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild threat, violence, rude humour\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":96,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4-k8Hg7SZas\",\"displayPriority\":15,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000003\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001112\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002204\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016137\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016138\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016139\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016140\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016141\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"9353\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001014\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001107\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001108\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001109\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002485\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002508\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002640\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e5808809-5d74-4074-ba7d-547c6d87a1b4\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007638\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008678\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Paramount Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Housemaid\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. From director Paul Feig, the film plunges audiences into a twisted world where perfection is an illusion, and nothing is as it seems. Trying to escape her past, Millie (Sweeney) accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina (Seyfried) and Andrew Winchester (Brandon Sklenar). But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous — a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power. Behind the Winchesters’ closed doors lies a world of shocking twists that will leave you guessing until the very end.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, sex, sexual violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-22\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kdDdlY2VPxw\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009161\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012707\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016976\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016977\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000031\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000135\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000814\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewM