y Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, injury detail, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":150,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s9gSuKaKcqM\",\"displayPriority\":7,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001370\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012950\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014188\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014753\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017170\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017171\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17172\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17173\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17174\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90e71dd1-a916-4807-8aff-0dd9f141e72d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008101\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009187\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008152\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Behind The Scenes\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Aderonke “Ronky-Fella” Faniran, a mother of two and successful real estate mogul, is loved for her generosity. But as everyone around her grows to expect her kindness, she gives until there’s nothing left, neglecting herself in the process.\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Aderonke “Ronky-Fella” Faniran, a mother of two and successful real estate mogul, is loved for her generosity. But as everyone around her grows to expect her kindness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"brief strong injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-12\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":143,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007762\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010941\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013436\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013978\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015198\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015590\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017281\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017283\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017285\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017287\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17575\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17577\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17578\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ef8d4378-439a-4ea5-9c44-cf84c6290cb0\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008152\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009242\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"(New) FilmOne Distribution LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008177\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Giant\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Based on the remarkable true story of legendary British-Yemeni boxing champion Prince Naseem \\\"Naz\\\" Hamed and his relationship with Irish boxing trainer Brendan Ingle, GIANT charts Naz’s inspiring rags-to-riches underdog tale from his humble beginnings in Sheffield to becoming champion of the world.\\n\\nWith his unorthodox style, cocky persona and sheer dominance of the sport, Naseem faced down the abhorrent racism and islamophobia that swept Britain in the 80’s and 90’s, to become a global sporting icon, both inside and outside of the ring.\\n\\nThe film explores the unlikely and tender relationship between Naz and his trainer Ingle – a steel industry worker who ran a humble boxing gym in a church hall in the North of England; and the instrumental role that Ingle played on Naz’s road to success. With exhilarating and visceral scenes in the ring, coupled with deeply moving and intimate moments behind the curtain, GIANT is an inspiring biopic of one of the greatest showmen the sporting world has even seen – the untold true story of the boy behind The Prince.\\n\\nPierce Brosnan (James Bond franchise, Mamma Mia!, The Love Punch, Mobland) stars as Brendan Ingle, with Amir El-Masry (The Night Manager, Limbo, The Crown, SAS: Rogue Heroes) playing Naseem Hamed. From executive producer Sylvester Stallone (Rocky, Creed), GIANT is written and directed by film-maker Rowan Athale (Gangs of London).\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The remarkable real-life story of legendary British-Yemeni boxer Prince Naseem \\\"Naz\\\" Hamed.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, discrimination\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iUYO2kk1Fek\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000949\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003156\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017331\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017333\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001836\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000023\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"1c43a4ae-d161-4502-9f9e-6ae2973ddcd3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008177\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009268\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"True Brit Entertainment LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008189\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong gory violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyYliP8dPWU\",\"displayPriority\":9,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000097\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000442\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002404\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002653\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005575\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014011\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014577\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017356\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"12790418-6492-492a-814c-53673bc1ab1a\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008189\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009281\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008191\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Rental Family\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery through the roles he plays in other people’s lives.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007702\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008791\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008792\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017357\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017358\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017359\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017360\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017361\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a2ea80c3-a876-47ff-9c5c-0cddaeae7ddd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008191\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009283\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008193\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Mercy\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge (Rebecca Ferguson) he once championed, before it determines his fate.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, threat, injury detail, drug misuse, strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sN-C09dfczY\",\"displayPriority\":12,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003235\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009008\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017362\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017363\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017364\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000086\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000825\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000982\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001684\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002432\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eea3fe00-3e2b-4dcc-9150-aedd76790a42\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008193\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009285\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008222\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Saipan\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"SAIPAN explores the explosive clash between soccer star Roy Keane and manager Mick McCarthy before the 2002 FIFA World Cup. Their feud, rooted in clashing standards and personalities, erupted on the island of Saipan, shaking the Irish team and nation. As Keane walked out, McCarthy faced chaos. This gripping true story goes beyond sport, it’s a dramatic, often comic tale of leadership, loyalty, and a rivalry that captured global attention.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"SAIPAN explores the explosive clash between soccer star Roy Keane and manager Mick McCarthy before the 2002 FIFA World Cup.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s4TzwHPsq_s\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000111\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000112\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012549\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017369\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017420\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017421\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"15f1abd4-8ed9-44f9-bb19-c7de8145ff5e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008222\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009316\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"VERTIGO RELEASING LIMITED\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008306\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Back To The Past (Cantonese)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the Qin Dynasty, time-traveller Hong Siu-lung (Louis Koo) has lived in seclusion with his family for twenty years. Yet every step he takes remains under the watchful eye of his former disciple, now the Qin Emperor (Raymond Lam). On the brink of ultimate power after conquering the six warring states, the emperor is suddenly ambushed by a mysterious team wielding advanced weapons clearly originating from Hong’s time. Drawn together by fate again, Hong and Qin Emperor are forced to confront the long-buried conflict between them, because the future now depends on how they settle their past.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the Qin Dynasty, time-traveller Hong Siu-lung (Louis Koo) has lived in seclusion with his family for twenty years. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-31\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":107,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009552\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012294\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017570\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017571\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017572\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017573\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017574\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3ac35814-325d-4762-a793-507b4ad988bd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008306\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009402\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Trinity Filmed Entertainment\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008321\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"A Very Dirty Christmas\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"When Jade, a stripper, goes missing, her sisters follow a trail from Lagos to Abuja and Ashe, uncovering a counterfeit drug syndicate tied to their own father, Don Phil. As they close in, a deadly rivalry explodes at the Ashe Carnival, forcing them to fight for their family’s survival\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"When Jade, a stripper, goes missing, her sisters follow a trail from Lagos to Abuja and Ashe, uncovering a counterfeit drug syndicate tied to their own father, Don Phil. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong sex references, threat, bloody violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":113,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011371\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011781\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013123\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013976\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016854\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017612\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"593\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5258d6c7-c5fd-4fd0-a353-69c3940585e5\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008321\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009419\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Evrit Films\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008325\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Return to Silent Hill\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"When a mysterious letter calls him back to Silent Hill in search of his lost love, James finds a once-recognizable town and encounters terrifying figures both familiar and new, and begins to question his own sanity.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"When a mysterious letter calls him back to Silent Hill in search of his lost love, James finds a once-recognizable town and encounters terrifying figures.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong horror, gore, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":105,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":11,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001177\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003901\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012885\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012886\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017616\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017618\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"0004c65f-7fef-466d-afe4-7bab15b10fa6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008325\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009423\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008327\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Man-su (Lee Byung Hun), a specialist in paper manufacturing with 25 years of experience, is so satisfied with life that he can truthfully tell himself, “I’ve got it all.” While happily passing his days with his wife Miri (Son Yejin), their two children and two dogs, Man-su is suddenly informed by his company that he has been fired.\\n“We’re sorry. We have no other choice.”\\nFeeling shocked as if his head had been cut off by an ax, Man-su vows to find himself a new job within the next three months for the sake of his family. Despite his firm resolve to turn his life around, Man-su spends over a year drifting from one job interview after another, and working at a retail store. He eventually finds himself in danger of losing the very house that he struggled so hard to buy.\\nDesperate, he visits Moon Paper out of the blue and tries to hand over his CV, but he just ends up getting humiliated by line manager Choi Sun-chul (Park Hee Soon). Man-su knows he is better qualified than anyone to work at Moon Paper, so he comes to a certain decision.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, violence, injury detail, sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":13,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010701\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016863\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017619\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017620\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017621\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017622\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e660de4a-88af-472a-a1e1-57ffb9dcbb49\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008327\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009425\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI UK Ltd\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008348\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Another World (Cantonese)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After death and before reincarnation, the souls of the deceased pass through a fantastical realm known as, Another World. GUDO is a spirit tasked with guiding these transient souls to their next life. \\nWhile helping a young girl named YURI, he learns that humans have emotions that he does not understand, and his curiosity is stirred. He befriends Yuri and promises to always be with her through her difficult journey. \\nHowever, Yuri harbors a rare curse that could threaten humanity and upset the balance of the universe if she is fully consumed by anger. Through Gudo’s revelation, Yuri discovers a grave sin she committed in her past life. Unable to forgive herself, her growing anger risks unleashing the hidden curse. Charged by Goddess Mira to prevent this threat, Gudo embarks on a perilous thousand-year mission. \\nDespite constant conflicts with his guardian, Dark Sky, Gudo insists on giving Yuri a second chance at the risk of his life. He learns that forgiveness and inner peace is the only way to overcome the anger within and heal a broken world. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Tasked to help transient souls through Another World to their reincarnation, the spirit GUDO meets a young girl called YURI, and embarks on a dangerous journey.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, suicide\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":111,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007432\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010662\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011602\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017652\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017653\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017654\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017655\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17714\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000011\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3dceaa5a-a39d-4c4c-96fc-f1219e6c2820\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008348\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009446\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Central City Media LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008390\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Iron Lung\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The stars are gone. The planets have disappeared. Only individuals aboard space stations or starships were left to give the end a name - The Quiet Rapture. After decades of decay and crumbling infrastructure, the Consolidation of Iron has made a discovery on a barren moon designated AT-5. An ocean of blood.\\u2028 Hoping to discover desperately needed resources they immediately launch an expedition. A submarine is crafted and a convict is welded inside. Due to the pressure and depth of the ocean the forward viewport has been encased in metal. If successful, they will earn their freedom. If not, another will follow. This will be the 13th expedition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The stars are gone. The planets have disappeared. Only those on space stations or starships were left to give the end a name. The Quiet Rapture. The universe dims.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, bloody images, threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":125,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017729\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4187d757-ba5e-42e9-9ba3-f3aa56e6b45f\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008390\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009492\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"(New) Iron Lung Inc\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008394\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Heavyweight\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"As fight time approaches, Heavyweight explores the fragile mental state of a fighter and his cornermen backstage, where pressure, expectation, and doubt collide.\\n\\nWith the clock ticking, a series of internal and external obstacles cause the fighter to lose faith in himself. As his team works tirelessly to remind him that he deserves his place in the ring, Derek begins to understand that the greatest weight he carries isn’t physical.\\n\\nTo move forward, he must cut ties with the version of himself that’s holding him back - and face his most formidable opponent yet: himself.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"As fight time approaches, Heavyweight explores the fragile mental state of a fighter and his cornermen backstage, where pressure, expectation, and doubt collide.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":98,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=27ILcGfhAuM\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003044\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013252\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013492\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017743\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017744\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017745\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017746\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017747\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017748\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017749\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017750\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002412\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"7a081814-d64a-48dc-8b2a-63e466ccabda\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008394\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009496\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Buff Business Group LTD\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000003440\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Byron\",\"familyName\":\"Howard\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003441\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jared\",\"familyName\":\"Bush\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003443\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Yvett Merino\",\"familyName\":\"Flores\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000006395\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jason\",\"familyName\":\"Bateman\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000008394\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ginnifer\",\"familyName\":\"Goodwin\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000015583\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Rolando\",\"familyName\":\"Davila-Beltran\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000015584\",\"name\":{\"give