violence, injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":89,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L9Odp8RvbLo\",\"displayPriority\":10,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017524\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017525\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017526\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017528\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017529\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017530\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017532\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017533\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002732\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"67aa2582-ac18-4747-8f49-005d24853af3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008273\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009367\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Paramount Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008280\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"LOTR: The Two Towers - Extended Edition\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"While Frodo and Sam edge closer to Mordor with the help of the shifty Gollum, the divided fellowship makes a stand against Sauron's new ally, Saruman, and his hordes of Isengard.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"While Frodo and Sam edge closer to Mordor with the help of the shifty Gollum, the divided fellowship makes a stand against Sauron's new ally, Saruman, and his hordes...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":235,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000675\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000857\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000858\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000859\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000860\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000861\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000862\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000863\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000864\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000866\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000867\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000868\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000869\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000871\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000872\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009623\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000138\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000009\",\"0000000011\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008280\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009374\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WARNER BROS DISTRIBUTORS LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008325\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Return to Silent Hill\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"When a mysterious letter calls him back to Silent Hill in search of his lost love, James finds a once-recognizable town and encounters terrifying figures both familiar and new, and begins to question his own sanity.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"When a mysterious letter calls him back to Silent Hill in search of his lost love, James finds a once-recognizable town and encounters terrifying figures.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong horror, gore, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":105,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":11,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001177\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003901\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012885\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012886\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017616\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017618\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"0004c65f-7fef-466d-afe4-7bab15b10fa6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008325\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009423\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008327\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Man-su (Lee Byung Hun), a specialist in paper manufacturing with 25 years of experience, is so satisfied with life that he can truthfully tell himself, “I’ve got it all.” While happily passing his days with his wife Miri (Son Yejin), their two children and two dogs, Man-su is suddenly informed by his company that he has been fired.\\n“We’re sorry. We have no other choice.”\\nFeeling shocked as if his head had been cut off by an ax, Man-su vows to find himself a new job within the next three months for the sake of his family. Despite his firm resolve to turn his life around, Man-su spends over a year drifting from one job interview after another, and working at a retail store. He eventually finds himself in danger of losing the very house that he struggled so hard to buy.\\nDesperate, he visits Moon Paper out of the blue and tries to hand over his CV, but he just ends up getting humiliated by line manager Choi Sun-chul (Park Hee Soon). Man-su knows he is better qualified than anyone to work at Moon Paper, so he comes to a certain decision.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, violence, injury detail, sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":13,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010701\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016863\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017619\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017620\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017621\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017622\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e660de4a-88af-472a-a1e1-57ffb9dcbb49\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008327\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009425\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI UK Ltd\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008348\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Another World (Cantonese)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After death and before reincarnation, the souls of the deceased pass through a fantastical realm known as, Another World. GUDO is a spirit tasked with guiding these transient souls to their next life. \\nWhile helping a young girl named YURI, he learns that humans have emotions that he does not understand, and his curiosity is stirred. He befriends Yuri and promises to always be with her through her difficult journey. \\nHowever, Yuri harbors a rare curse that could threaten humanity and upset the balance of the universe if she is fully consumed by anger. Through Gudo’s revelation, Yuri discovers a grave sin she committed in her past life. Unable to forgive herself, her growing anger risks unleashing the hidden curse. Charged by Goddess Mira to prevent this threat, Gudo embarks on a perilous thousand-year mission. \\nDespite constant conflicts with his guardian, Dark Sky, Gudo insists on giving Yuri a second chance at the risk of his life. He learns that forgiveness and inner peace is the only way to overcome the anger within and heal a broken world. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Tasked to help transient souls through Another World to their reincarnation, the spirit GUDO meets a young girl called YURI, and embarks on a dangerous journey.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, suicide\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":111,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007432\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010662\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011602\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017652\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017653\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017654\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017655\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17714\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000011\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3dceaa5a-a39d-4c4c-96fc-f1219e6c2820\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008348\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009446\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Central City Media LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008366\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Melania\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself — step inside Melania Trump's world as she orchestrates inauguration plans, navigates the complexities of the White House transition, and reenters public life with her family. With exclusive footage capturing critical meetings, private conversations, and never-before-seen environments, Mrs. Trump returns to one of the world's most powerful roles.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild bad language, upsetting scenes, brief sexual violence references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":104,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002852\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017676\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017677\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000008\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e0b807dc-6fff-41b2-90d7-5637351348c3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008366\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009466\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SHEAR ENTERTAINMENT\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008390\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Iron Lung\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The stars are gone. The planets have disappeared. Only individuals aboard space stations or starships were left to give the end a name - The Quiet Rapture. After decades of decay and crumbling infrastructure, the Consolidation of Iron has made a discovery on a barren moon designated AT-5. An ocean of blood.\\u2028 Hoping to discover desperately needed resources they immediately launch an expedition. A submarine is crafted and a convict is welded inside. Due to the pressure and depth of the ocean the forward viewport has been encased in metal. If successful, they will earn their freedom. If not, another will follow. This will be the 13th expedition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The stars are gone. The planets have disappeared. Only those on space stations or starships were left to give the end a name. The Quiet Rapture. The universe dims.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, bloody images, threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":125,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017729\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4187d757-ba5e-42e9-9ba3-f3aa56e6b45f\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008390\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009492\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"(New) Iron Lung Inc\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000003440\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Byron\",\"familyName\":\"Howard\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003441\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jared\",\"familyName\":\"Bush\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003443\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Yvett Merino\",\"familyName\":\"Flores\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000006395\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jason\",\"familyName\":\"Bateman\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000008394\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ginnifer\",\"familyName\":\"Goodwin\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000015583\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Rolando\",\"familyName\":\"Davila-Beltran\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000015584\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Fortune\",\"familyName\":\"Feimster\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000082\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jennifer\",\"familyName\":\"Lee\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000488\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Shakira\",\"familyName\":\"\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00002397\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ke\",\"familyName\":\"Huy Quan\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000560\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Kate\",\"familyName\":\"Winslet\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000002207\",\"name\":{\"givenName\