{\"line1\":\"Bugsby's Way\",\"line2\":\"Greenwich\",\"city\":\"London\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00007316\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Zootropolis 2\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Brave rabbit cop Judy Hopps and her friend, the fox Nick Wilde, team up again to crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate of their careers.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Brave rabbit cop Judy Hopps and her friend, the fox Nick Wilde, team up again to crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate of their careers.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild threat, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":6,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003440\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003441\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003443\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015583\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015584\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000082\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000488\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002397\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"87004e42-c4bd-4468-8b83-00f122c59dd9\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007316\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008328\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007331\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"R.E.M. X Buster Keaton's Sherlock Jr.\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Silents Synced pairs classic silent movies with epic rock music to bring audiences a unique big screen experience. Buster Keaton’s 1924 comedy classic is reimagined with R.E.M. 's alt-rock masterpieces Monster (1994) and New Adventures in Hi-Fi (1996). \\n\\nIn this sublime comedy teetering between reality and illusion, Buster Keaton stars as a film projectionist who dreams of becoming a detective. He uses his limited skills when he is framed by a rival for stealing his girlfriend’s father’s pocket watch. Keaton reportedly broke his neck performing one of the many dangerous practical stunts in the film. Whether you’re a movie lover or a rock music fan this is an experience you won’t want to miss!!\\n\\nSherlock Jr. will be preceded by a special presentation of one of Keaton’s classic short film works, The Balloonatic(1923), soundtracked by a new composition by renowned Brazilian electronic artist, Amon Tobin.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Silents Synced pairs classic silent movies with epic rock music to bring audiences a unique big screen experience.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":72,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000055\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"6862c9ac-cc5c-46e7-a2fa-a058a8f70212\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007331\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008347\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"CinemaLive Limited\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007533\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang, as the conflict on Pandora escalates and a new moral focus emerges.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":197,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":8,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000560\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002207\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002294\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005786\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005787\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007837\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17711\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17712\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17713\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000042\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000349\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000696\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002427\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000010\",\"0000000011\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a4cb369f-77c4-4fe1-8f85-dd5e76b195dd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007533\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008563\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Housemaid\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. From director Paul Feig, the film plunges audiences into a twisted world where perfection is an illusion, and nothing is as it seems. Trying to escape her past, Millie (Sweeney) accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina (Seyfried) and Andrew Winchester (Brandon Sklenar). But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous — a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power. Behind the Winchesters’ closed doors lies a world of shocking twists that will leave you guessing until the very end.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, sex, sexual violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-22\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kdDdlY2VPxw\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009161\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012707\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016976\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016977\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000031\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000135\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000814\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001305\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"dc7be94d-5ba5-4a79-accd-48ed4d19a3b6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008012\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009092\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"LIONSGATE INTERNATIONAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008080\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, brief moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003903\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011027\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017134\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000321\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000322\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001794\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001974\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000005\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"37b2b94f-65a0-481e-9d3c-bde2445c99a4\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008080\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009165\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"UNIVERSAL PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008101\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, injury detail, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":150,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s9gSuKaKcqM\",\"displayPriority\":7,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001370\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012950\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014188\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014753\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017170\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017171\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17172\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17173\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17174\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90e71dd1-a916-4807-8aff-0dd9f141e72d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008101\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009187\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008152\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Behind The Scenes\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Aderonke “Ronky-Fella” Faniran, a mother of two and successful real estate mogul, is loved for her generosity. But as everyone around her grows to expect her kindness, she gives until there’s nothing left, neglecting herself in the process.\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Aderonke “Ronky-Fella” Faniran, a mother of two and successful real estate mogul, is loved for her generosity. But as everyone around her grows to expect her kindness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"brief strong injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-12\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":143,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007762\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010941\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013436\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013978\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015198\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015590\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017281\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017283\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017285\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017287\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17575\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17577\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17578\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ef8d4378-439a-4ea5-9c44-cf84c6290cb0\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008152\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009242\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"(New) FilmOne Distribution LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008177\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Giant\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Based on the remarkable true story of legendary British-Yemeni boxing champion Prince Naseem \\\"Naz\\\" Hamed and his relationship with Irish boxing trainer Brendan Ingle, GIANT charts Naz’s inspiring rags-to-riches underdog tale from his humble beginnings in Sheffield to becoming champion of the world.\\n\\nWith his unorthodox style, cocky persona and sheer dominance of the sport, Naseem faced down the abhorrent racism and islamophobia that swept Britain in the 80’s and 90’s, to become a global sporting icon, both inside and outside of the ring.\\n\\nThe film explores the unlikely and tender relationship between Naz and his trainer Ingle – a steel industry worker who ran a humble boxing gym in a church hall in the North of England; and the instrumental role that Ingle played on Naz’s road to success. With exhilarating and visceral scenes in the ring, coupled with deeply moving and intimate moments behind the curtain, GIANT is an inspiring biopic of one of the greatest showmen the sporting world has even seen – the untold true story of the boy behind The Prince.\\n\\nPierce Brosnan (James Bond franchise, Mamma Mia!, The Love Punch, Mobland) stars as Brendan Ingle, with Amir El-Masry (The Night Manager, Limbo, The Crown, SAS: Rogue Heroes) playing Naseem Hamed. From executive producer Sylvester Stallone (Rocky, Creed), GIANT is written and directed by film-maker Rowan Athale (Gangs of London).\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The remarkable real-life story of legendary British-Yemeni boxer Prince Naseem \\\"Naz\\\" Hamed.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, discrimination\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iUYO2kk1Fek\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000949\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003156\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017331\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017333\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001836\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000023\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"1c43a4ae-d161-4502-9f9e-6ae2973ddcd3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008177\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009268\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"True Brit Entertainment LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008189\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong gory violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyYliP8dPWU\",\"displayPriority\":9,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000097\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000442\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002404\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002653\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005575\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014011\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014577\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017356\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"12790418-6492-492a-814c-53673bc1ab1a\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008189\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009281\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008191\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Rental Family\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery through the roles he plays in other people’s lives.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007702\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008791\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008792\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017357\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017358\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017359\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017360\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017361\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a2ea80c3-a876-47ff-9c5c-0cddaeae7ddd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008191\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009283\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008193\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Mercy\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge (Rebecca Ferguson) he once championed, before it determines his fate.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In the near future, a detective (Chris Pratt) stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has 90 minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced A.I. Judge.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, threat, injury detail, drug misuse, strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sN-C09dfczY\",\"displayPriority\":12,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003235\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009008\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017362\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017363\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017364\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000086\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000825\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000982\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001684\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002432\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eea3fe00-3e2b-4dcc-9150-aedd76790a42\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008193\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009285\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008195\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Is This Thing On?\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family — forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":121,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ngmu5zGOa7s\",\"displayPriority\":11,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000027\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000883\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004642\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017365\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017366\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017367\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"30\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c59e6ef3-faa4-469e-9fc7-2d8997cff25e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008195\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009287\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008222\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Saipan\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"SAIPAN explores the explosive clash between soccer star Roy Keane and manager Mick McCarthy before the 2002 FIFA World Cup. Their feud, rooted in clashing standards and personalities, erupted on the island of Saipan, shaking the Irish team and nation. As Keane walked out, McCarthy faced chaos. This gripping true story goes beyond sport, it’s a dramatic, often comic tale of leadership, loyalty, and a rivalry that captured global attention.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"SAIPAN explores the explosive clash between soccer star Roy Keane and manager Mick McCarthy before the 2002 FIFA World Cup.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s4TzwHPsq_s\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000111\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000112\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012549\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017369\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017420\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017421\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"15f1abd4-8ed9-44f9-bb19-c7de8145ff5e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008222\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009316\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"VERTIGO RELEASING LIMITED\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008237\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Shelter\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"On a remote coastal island, a man living in self-imposed exile rescues a young girl from a deadly storm. This action sets off a chain of events, bringing him out of seclusion and both into harm’s way. As their lives intertwine, he must navigate protecting the orphaned girl while battling enemies from is past - setting them both on a breathless odyssey for survival and a deeper journey toward redemption.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"On a remote coastal island, a man living in self-imposed exile rescues a young girl from a deadly storm.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":107,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000262\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001557\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002147\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014866\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016569\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017459\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000088\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000251\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001694\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001819\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000007\",\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9e3b2fd7-c5b2-4dee-857d-9dc3d230e4cd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008237\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009331\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008239\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Kangaroo\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"KANGAROO is a heart-warming family comedy about ex TV personality, Chris Masterman, who becomes stranded in an Outback town outside Alice Springs. There, he teams up with 12-year-old Indigenous girl Charlie. The pair form an unlikely friendship and work together to rescue and rehabilitate orphaned joeys in the remote but stunning Outback community - an endeavour that proves to be life-changing for them both.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"KANGAROO is a heart-warming family comedy about an ex-TV personality Chris Masterman, who becomes stranded in an Outback town after a car accident on his way to Broome. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild bad language, threat, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":107,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BAwuJ74KP6U\",\"displayPriority\":12,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002636\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006784\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011449\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011614\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012011\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016712\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016713\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016714\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016715\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016716\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016717\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016718\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016719\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016720\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016721\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016722\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016723\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016724\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016725\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002378\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2190fa2f-4101-475d-848f-b328ee1f0b8d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008239\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009333\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"STUDIOCANAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008273\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Primate\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In PRIMATE, a group of friends’ tropical vacation turns into a terrifying, primal tale of horror and survival.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In PRIMATE, a group of friends’ tropical vacation turns into a terrifying, primal tale of horror and survival.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":89,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L9Odp8RvbLo\",\"displayPriority\":10,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017524\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017525\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017526\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017528\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017529\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017530\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017532\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017533\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002732\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"67aa2582-ac18-4747-8f49-005d24853af3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008273\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009367\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Paramount Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008310\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Send Help\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two colleagues become stranded on a deserted island, the only survivors of a plane crash. On the island, they must overcome past grievances and work together to survive, but ultimately, it's a battle of wills and wits to make it out alive.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two colleagues become stranded on a deserted island, the only survivors of a plane crash. On the island, they must overcome past grievances and work together to survive. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":113,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NwR6J0W4XN0\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005399\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009978\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000303\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001664\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001891\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"d6fe525e-3f8f-4e06-ba6b-7bcad91081ff\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008310\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009406\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008325\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Return to Silent Hill\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"When a mysterious letter calls him back to Silent Hill in search of his lost love, James finds a once-recognizable town and encounters terrifying figures both familiar and new, and begins to question his own sanity.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"When a mysterious letter calls him back to Silent Hill in search of his lost love, James finds a once-recognizable town and encounters terrifying figures.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong horror, gore, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":105,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":11,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001177\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003901\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012885\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012886\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017616\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017618\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"0004c65f-7fef-466d-afe4-7bab15b10fa6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008325\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009423\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008327\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Man-su (Lee Byung Hun), a specialist in paper manufacturing with 25 years of experience, is so satisfied with life that he can truthfully tell himself, “I’ve got it all.” While happily passing his days with his wife Miri (Son Yejin), their two children and two dogs, Man-su is suddenly informed by his company that he has been fired.\\n“We’re sorry. We have no other choice.”\\nFeeling shocked as if his head had been cut off by an ax, Man-su vows to find himself a new job within the next three months for the sake of his family. Despite his firm resolve to turn his life around, Man-su spends over a year drifting from one job interview after another, and working at a retail store. He eventually finds himself in danger of losing the very house that he struggled so hard to buy.\\nDesperate, he visits Moon Paper out of the blue and tries to hand over his CV, but he just ends up getting humiliated by line manager Choi Sun-chul (Park Hee Soon). Man-su knows he is better qualified than anyone to work at Moon Paper, so he comes to a certain decision.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, violence, injury detail, sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":13,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010701\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016863\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017619\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017620\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017621\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017622\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e660de4a-88af-472a-a1e1-57ffb9dcbb49\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008327\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009425\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI UK Ltd\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008348\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Another World (Cantonese)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After death and before reincarnation, the souls of the deceased pass through a fantastical realm known as, Another World. GUDO is a spirit tasked with guiding these transient souls to their next life. \\nWhile helping a young girl named YURI, he learns that humans have emotions that he does not understand, and his curiosity is stirred. He befriends Yuri and promises to always be with her through her difficult journey. \\nHowever, Yuri harbors a rare curse that could threaten humanity and upset the balance of the universe if she is fully consumed by anger. Through Gudo’s revelation, Yuri discovers a grave sin she committed in her past life. Unable to forgive herself, her growing anger risks unleashing the hidden curse. Charged by Goddess Mira to prevent this threat, Gudo embarks on a perilous thousand-year mission. \\nDespite constant conflicts with his guardian, Dark Sky, Gudo insists on giving Yuri a second chance at the risk of his life. He learns that forgiveness and inner peace is the only way to overcome the anger within and heal a broken world. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Tasked to help transient souls through Another World to their reincarnation, the spirit GUDO meets a young girl called YURI, and embarks on a dangerous journey.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, suicide\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":111,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007432\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010662\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011602\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017652\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017653\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017654\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017655\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17714\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000011\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3dceaa5a-a39d-4c4c-96fc-f1219e6c2820\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008348\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009446\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Central City Media LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008366\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Melania\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself — step inside Melania Trump's world as she orchestrates inauguration plans, navigates the complexities of the White House transition, and reenters public life with her family. With exclusive footage capturing critical meetings, private conversations, and never-before-seen environments, Mrs. Trump returns to one of the world's most powerful roles.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild bad language, upsetting scenes, brief sexual violence references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":104,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002852\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017676\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017677\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000008\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e0b807dc-6fff-41b2-90d7-5637351348c3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008366\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009466\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SHEAR ENTERTAINMENT\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008431\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Mardaani 3\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The blockbuster Mardaani franchise has received unanimous love from people and has attained a cult status amongst cine-lovers. Mardaani 3 will see Rani Mukerji reprise the role of a daredevil cop, Shivani Shivaji Roy, who selflessly fights for justice. This film will be a bloody, violent clash between Shivani’s goodness vs sinister evil forces as she begins an extraordinary race against time to hunt and rescue scores of missing girls of the country.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Mardaani 3 will see Rani Mukerji reprise the role of a daredevil cop, Shivani Shivaji Roy, who selflessly fights for justice. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong threat, violence, injury detail, sexual threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":130,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V4TJKSEftkU\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000714\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011547\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017800\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"17860\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002020\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"96f02b86-c02e-4978-bb33-f79eeb7ad66d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008431\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009536\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"YASH RAJ FILMS LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008474\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Sinners (IMAX)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Trying to leave their troubled lives behind, twin brothers (Jordan) return to their hometown to start again, only to discover that an even greater evil is waiting to welcome them back.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Twin brothers return to their hometown to start their lives over, where they encounter an evil presence that's been waiting to welcome them back.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\